WEBVTT

00:00:03.507 --> 00:00:04.273
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:05.151 --> 00:00:07.653
<v><b>A:</b></v> Carrots are sweeter than tomatoes.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:10.640
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:14.657
<v><b>B:</b></v> Air travel is safer than train travel.

00:00:16.839 --> 00:00:17.640
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.598 --> 00:00:21.258
<v><b>A:</b></v> London is wetter than Milan.

00:00:23.499 --> 00:00:24.385
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:28.027
<v><b>B:</b></v> A horse is heavier than a car.

00:00:30.242 --> 00:00:31.029
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:35.050
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oranges are healthier than strawberries.

00:00:37.421 --> 00:00:38.267
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:43.151
<v><b>B:</b></v> Istanbul is further north than New York.